{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0bcc419129d27e87ff2979e99634f8aef8cb6c74d7e3d4d28ef3b4d9837b26d0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c750f2ace9684a530b2b84eb0fbbbdbdb7126b587e2627eba80708e08f2970a","slc_eb1a915dad6366db6a1761aededa7914b54d5f421f49f573579bfd43928d8426"],"source_ids":["src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"mindwalk is a visualization tool that replays coding-agent sessions as light moving through a night-style map of the codebase, showing where the agent searched, read, and edited.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_20f2dcb8b073e39e03dfea3cd5967653eaeb5aaef156f94d2139a5fea584a27f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e0866d9f0629d2a55eb245e1506ad86442a6e9c76e2dbd92a8b4a52514ca4fc","slc_cef49873a4f5f6312e4f0cb7aa8addfb57596db3d33d308ed0f9f5c444d9cb14"],"source_ids":["src_035c9a49c9dc5f369e041896e498e515","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"Verdicts are never decided by the model: Go mechanically rolls up dimension and criterion verdicts from finding severities and coverage grades, strips hallucinated citations, and retries once on invalid output.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_33f2d1659583ddf2381bc63fb576f774a8853987e03230f16968b1ae9a670e51","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_16542d6c339347936ede50d82bfe9f2262957ad5efc682c4e7a9e55c22a00361","slc_da45ec911978e0a6e1288eebf771990fb36c868067f95994705061a9edc16dfc"],"source_ids":["src_035c9a49c9dc5f369e041896e498e515","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"The judge subprocess runs sealed: it gets no tools, no MCP servers, no user or project settings, and no session persistence, and it only receives the evaluated session's summary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3d37ba67b7f4146dd98677d44f7ebdfffdc98277eab73f5a148d3723863acbdf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05782425f89f70067ec94fc11b3adc96503bed7eb1076125e2f78c68590b3fa0","slc_23b976d5656e1ab2f3aa53dcb75a5b0c63244ff6bbed5c1f642848d93dafc75f","slc_b3a8c4c76d0ec0a44b4326382b8fe381d7429a0b9e1089652f1863d1ab4cdc61"],"source_ids":["src_035c9a49c9dc5f369e041896e498e515","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"Evaluation reports are cached one per session in ~/.mindwalk/reports, go stale without auto-rerun when session content changes, and reuse the drafted rubric when task wording is unchanged.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_44a094a2ff181810d8f487d8c2ecd5ffd28f0fd9c0411e6fefc77714e262c135","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_33c5ad35f3106f718efb335d6bed22fa76ea41a62a2589486676105b2acdb3de","slc_5a9b5925aa4df5426ae5ce9e8c9047ea4b440010dfbcc72b738095cc959d0221","slc_8ed8b0cffebe99e820e3ca3693eff4daca11602c7c01799ee160c920723e62e3","slc_cb842bc7fb07229e545fdbf62d3c8b61d31ff3897a889f2198cbb0095419cfb8"],"source_ids":["src_8c0d0761fb995c53ace293dbf423b0f0","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors run make setup, make serve (dev server on :8765), make test before sending a PR, and make build to regenerate embedded assets; Go code must stay gofmt-ed and internal/server/static must never be hand-edited.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6fd95171d84cb28be7cff5efa13b7c50098d12f6142e3809cf72fb226bde7876","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0da7b82d9bc71241bed605c659cef09c65176d949a6a335a474610796719438c","slc_3ea28068867c5788d6910c658ccb043a48c1fbd53dcc597ebed6f4962ab33ecc","slc_da45ec911978e0a6e1288eebf771990fb36c868067f95994705061a9edc16dfc"],"source_ids":["src_035c9a49c9dc5f369e041896e498e515","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"Session evaluation uses up to two sealed judge calls via the user's own claude or codex CLI: one drafting task-specific criteria from user messages, one unified scoring pass over four fixed process dimensions plus those criteria.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7bb51eb85d7c77ca6627777e149ed7dd8ced48b99511ea2fef7687fe93b25982","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_26b57f7d83349f9cda2595340a97602035bdfcae865f2771e53f7fcc7d5667b9","slc_8b398085d3862add2eca0dfcda00d1b94705b45801ea24f9702451b3a26d7130"],"source_ids":["src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"The system separates three artifacts: a normalized trace (internal/adapter, one adapter per agent format), a deterministic citymap (internal/citymap), and an LLM-judge report (internal/judge), joined by a local Go server serving a React/Three.js frontend.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9800024d7ab05d152206febdf72c2e1ae16bfaba7e0fd4e138a12049706a31ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37801c80fdfd340648029f764d79f3c78664eeb237bc48052c76562d70620356","slc_bbcff1f45e162c3af7d3f77c45d624a0bd864f87cdf647577304eeb8d841396a","slc_c11ef8bc41d30e54890cc1f99c1f9fa81868c1be31afdb246294542f9c5d33a7"],"source_ids":["src_05dcd8cf9d445a1bb00475d28d585947","src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"The UI encodes touch state as light on a dark ink-blue map (seen green, read blue, edited amber), with tree and terrain views, a playback histogram where observation stays cool and mutation glows warm, and glow treated strictly as data.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac9b82cfa8f0e7c9e321440ad868bcf358d1acde8b87332207d98bff3a24385e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c3aa72814aedc18353b45f44fc4352195deb8393864e2cde6b2b7c3a83eddc1"],"source_ids":["src_035c9a49c9dc5f369e041896e498e515"],"text":"The fixed process dimensions (exploration, scope, wandering, verification) are tuned for code-editing work and can be systematically too harsh on research, debugging, or documentation sessions, per the project's own design doc.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_adf0b9118e971e9cc57d7e5480c0497635cd8926d28d18dea801d458be25d7d4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b9e9843c70926e8a99eac9068e87a39e5ac9896ac56617b7c3c780dad2811857"],"source_ids":["src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"The CLI offers serve, open, map, build, trace, and analyze subcommands, with flags such as --port, --no-open, per-agent session dirs, --judge, --model, and --no-rubric.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d95e2692b6e32a30cce8164c78142f2e27290b79468b305ec90a4090ef071293","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"cosmtrek/mindwalk@77cd79596a1b snapshot 979a5969183bf46b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c750f2ace9684a530b2b84eb0fbbbdbdb7126b587e2627eba80708e08f2970a","slc_da45ec911978e0a6e1288eebf771990fb36c868067f95994705061a9edc16dfc"],"source_ids":["src_e00dfd2542fd5abbb900b598ef04f362"],"text":"The product is a single Go binary that runs fully locally; viewing sends nothing anywhere, with the only network use being the optional evaluation through the user's own agent CLI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c74696ab4229405586942d9e64e727a9"}
